Oakline

The surface rendering pipeline and blocks.json color data are adapted from
Dynamic Minecraft Mapping Tool (DMMT):
https://github.com/TizioKayoso/DMMT

Adaptations made in October 2026 replace DMMT's web service and tile pyramid
with an offline PNG command, add validated region and external chunk decoding, and add
powered-rail detection, graph reconstruction, station discovery, lane coloring,
map cropping, and station labels.

